          "settings": {
            "html": "<section class=\"ec-pillars-section\">\n  <div class=\"ec-pillars-header ec-reveal\">\n    <h2>What to <em>Expect</em></h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ec-pillars-grid\">\n    <div class=\"ec-pillar ec-reveal\">\n      <span class=\"ec-pillar-num\">I</span>\n      <h3>Intimacy</h3>\n      <p>We strictly limit capacity to preserve the sanctity of the space. You will never feel lost in a crowd; every retreat is a deeply personal journey.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ec-pillar ec-reveal\" style=\"transition-delay: 0.1s;\">\n      <span class=\"ec-pillar-num\">II</span>\n      <h3>Integration</h3>\n      <p>The experience doesn't end when you leave. We focus heavily on equipping you with tools to anchor the profound states of peace into your daily life.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ec-pillar ec-reveal\" style=\"transition-delay: 0.2s;\">\n      <span class=\"ec-pillar-num\">III</span>\n      <h3>Environment</h3>\n      <p>We source venues where nature does half the healing. Every location is vetted for its architectural harmony and energetic resonance.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap');\n\n*, *::before, *::after { margin: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; }\n\n:root {\n  --ec-stone: #0E1B30;\n  --ec-seafoam: #688F9D;\n  --ec-cream: #F7F0EC;\n}\n\n.ec-pillars-section {\n  padding: 8rem 4rem !important;\n  background: var(--ec-cream) !important;\n}\n\n.ec-pillars-header {\n  text-align: center !important;\n  margin-bottom: 4rem !important;\n}\n\n.ec-pillars-header h2 {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem) !important;\n  font-weight: 300 !important;\n  color: var(--ec-stone) !important;\n}\n\n.ec-pillars-header h2 em {\n  font-style: italic !important;\n  color: var(--ec-seafoam) !important;\n}\n\n.ec-pillars-grid {\n  max-width: 1100px !important;\n  margin: 0 auto !important;\n  display: grid !important;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) !important;\n  gap: 4rem !important;\n}\n\n.ec-pillar {\n  text-align: center !important;\n}\n\n.ec-pillar-num {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n  font-size: 2.5rem !important;\n  font-weight: 300 !important;\n  color: rgba(104,143,157,0.3) !important;\n  display: block !important;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n}\n\n.ec-pillar h3 {\n  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;\n  font-size: 1.4rem !important;\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  color: var(--ec-stone) !important;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n}\n\n.ec-pillar p {\n  font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif !important;\n  font-size: 0.88rem !important;\n  line-height: 1.9 !important;\n  color: rgba(14,27,48,0.65) !important;\n}\n\n.ec-reveal {\n  opacity: 0 !important;\n  transform: translateY(24px) !important;\n  transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease !important;\n}\n\n.ec-reveal.ec-visible {\n  opacity: 1 !important;\n  transform: translateY(0) !important;\n}\n\n@media(max-width: 768px) {\n  .ec-pillars-section {\n    padding: 5rem 1.5rem !important;\n  }\n  .ec-pillars-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\n    gap: 2rem !important;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    const observerOptions = {\n      root: null,\n      rootMargin: '0px',\n      threshold: 0.15\n    };\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries, obs) => {\n      entries.forEach(entry => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          entry.target.classList.add('ec-visible');\n          obs.unobserve(entry.target);\n        }\n      });\n    }, observerOptions);\n    document.querySelectorAll('.ec-reveal').forEach(element => {\n      observer.observe(element);\n    });\n  }, 500);\n</script>"
          },
          "widgetType": "html"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
